<section class="se-systems se-pad" id="EngineeringSystems"><header class="se-section-head"><div><p class="se-eyebrow">01 / MECHANICAL SPRING RESISTANCE</p><h2>Set up your<br>spring resistance.</h2></div><p>FLEX AIR uses mechanical springs.<br>Adjust the spring configuration manually.</p></header><div class="se-system-grid"><article><div class="se-system-photo"><img src="{{ 'sensol-air-parts-top.webp' | asset_url }}" width="3500" height="1969" loading="lazy" alt="FLEX AIR spring system in a straight product view"></div><div class="se-system-copy"><p class="se-eyebrow">FLEX AIR</p><h3>Mechanical springs.</h3><p>Adjust the spring configuration manually. FLEX AIR pairs its spring-based resistance system with an aluminium rail.</p><dl><div><dt>FLEX AIR springs</dt><dd>Chinese steel wire</dd></div></dl><a href="#EngineeringLab" data-engineering-inspect="0">See the FLEX AIR springs <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article></div></section>
